IMAPAccount gmail-main
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User ebrahimhagh2004@gmail.com
PassCmd "printenv GMAIL_MAIN_APP_PASSWORD"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore gmail-main-remote
Account gmail-main

MaildirStore gmail-main-local
Path /mail/
Inbox "/mail/gmail main"
SubFolders Verbatim
MaxSize 0

Channel gmail-main-inbox
Far :gmail-main-remote:INBOX
Near :gmail-main-local:
Sync Full
Create Both
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

